      "heading": "2 · Fluency with flexibility",
      "sentence": "Many ideas only help if they differ. Thirty sketches of the same sun are many ideas, but only one kind.",
      "quote": "It involves fluency, or the ability to generate a great quantity of ideas; flexibility, or the ability to switch from one perspective to another; and originality in picking unusual associations of ideas.",
